shing last happens. I mean, I had fun. It was a very animated and for me it was worth it.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: Thanks Sally. You're a good friend.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: Well, back to work. I better get the bartender to check the keg.<br />", "id": 2}, {"time": "77000", "image": "engenn9le18ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Joan</span>: Hey Vanessa. How was axe throwing today?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: It was \u2026 ok.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Joan</span>: Yeah. I was surprised Peter didn't go with you.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: You saw Peter?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Joan</span>: Yeah. He was at a Bistro downtown at about 1:30 having a drink and watching the game.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: You sure it was him?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Joan</span>: Yeah. He was wearing that crazy T-shirt he loves so much.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: Oh oh. Vanessa! Vanessa, wait!<br />", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 2, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}